{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"S06、S08提供不必强撑的温柔，S12提供心酸再现而力量未散的变化，因此珍惜与站稳不必二选一是有前文依据的推进，没有新增具体经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"温柔与自豪并立承接第1条及S12，力量从自我支撑延伸到欢欣，是对当前情绪的展开；积蓄已久的劲头也有前文反复维持力量、主动行动的铺垫。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"未定来自S09，S12又明确力量不会因心酸再现而消散，因此欢欣退去后旧疑问重新可感是已有矛盾的再次显现，不是新增往事或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"回落让结束变得具体把音乐的回落直接写成心理变化的原因；真正放下前又预设了他即将放下的心理场景，超出了已确立的未定与珍惜。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"progress\": \"是\",\n  \"progress_why\": \"首条直接承接S12心酸再现而力量仍在的变化，推进到温柔与昂扬并立，随后再写欢欣退去、未定重现，以及对珍惜之物真实分量的确认。\",\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条形成充实外涌、热烈回落、静止后重新确认在乎的清晰情绪弧线，各条也都交代了原因，不看听感记录仍能理解其叙述。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0ab29fb2-69dc-4c31-9fc0-279856f9e3cd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T223128187121Z", "elapsed_seconds": 114.953, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T22:33:23.145128+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "30bfaecf6b9237b1a810c188fb207d18b45ede481594565b9fc3e11cd09e7ff2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started